<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs $1.00-$1.25 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs $1.00-$1.25 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were</p>
<p>$1.00-1.25 lower.  Trading slow. Top $61.25 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs    60.75-61.25</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs    60.25-60.75</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs    59.25-60.25</p>
<p>	    280-290 lbs    58.25-59.25</p>
<p>US 3-4    290-300 lbs    57.25-58.25</p>
<p>Sows 300-600 lbs steady to 0.50 lower; 600-650 lbs fully 1.00 lower. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-600 lbs    48.25-49.00</p>
<p>	    600-650 lbs    47.50</p>
</text>
